ifferent details and on the side of  this building I'll have three different  facades and they're all just gonna  connect into this one big sort of Main  Street like building that I wanted to  get in here just to make this side of  the park look a little bit more like an  elven village as well and also to  actually get some functionality into  this part because at the moment there  are no toilets or anything of that sort  of thing so I wanted to get some toilets  in and this is just a good opportunity  to actually get some functionality into  this Park and actually allow the people  of the park to go to the toilets which  is pretty nice and pretty crucial  feature so there it goes which is gonna  sit in the building which is gonna be  right next to this building though so  yeah even though I won't finish this  facade in this video you'll be able to  see everything that I've made for this  place and the rest of the park which I  won't be filming a lot of what-what I  won't be filming is a lot of foliage  work a lot of just placing trees and all  these hills it's not that interesting I  think it's just you know in general  finishing the final touches of the park  and making sure that it's not located in  this very big empty grassy Greenland  there are also some other things that  I'll get into like making the queues  look nicer adding some extra detail  actually to like some of the other parts  of the park which I haven't focused on  so much like the entrance part or the  parts around the queue or the flat ride  that I've had for quite a while already  and also just adding some final touches  and tweaks to the existing things in the  park which doesn't really translate that  well into time-lapse anyway and it's  more or less that's everything that  you're gonna miss with me not recording  the final parts of making all of this  now with that out of the way there were  a couple of things that I kind of want  to talk about a little bit because I  haven't actually talked much about the  competition that I am  making this for basically it's  competition from from seeing themselves  it's not that special it's just a  competition for the best video and  you'll be there will be your like votes  and the jury on what's gonna be the best  video and there is no real objective way  to find out about it and I'm basically  more or less in it for the prize which  is really cool it's a meet and greet  with the frontier staff in Cambridge  like a paid dinner there's also a  foundation stone which for some reason  they put first but I'm not really sure  if I'm really that interested in it but  yeah it's really awesome price which is  why I'm giving it a try but I've seen so  many comments that I'm gonna win this  contest for sure and I kind of want to  speak up against that because I'm  actually not expecting myself to win and  I'm not trying to say that just to be  humble I'm well trying to say that  because I'm really not expecting myself  to win and I don't want to get all  pissed when I don't end up winning  because just in general it's a contest  for one it's just not objective anyone  can really win and it's a lot about the  creativity and you know what kind of new  things are original things you're  bringing to it as well  there's also just the fact that there's  already this idea in general that I'm a  favorite and I see a lot of people  saying that and I think what actually  makes the contest such such an  opportunity is that they're probably I  think rolling this contest to find some  creators who don't get as much of a  spotlight who make amazing things but  just aren't as well known for it  like if you've read the rules they can  actually use the footage from the  contest entries for any promotional ways  that they want to so they're probably  just looking in general to for you know  a good way to find out what the  community makes without having to go on  big hunts for actually what people make  and I think in that way it would also be  cool if the contest ends up you know  bringing forward some of the people who  aren't as well known but still make some  really amazing creations and make this  more of a contest about just the things  that are made rather than the people who  were entering it anyway we'll all see  who is gonna win the contest and how  this project ends up I'm gonna release  the final cinematic video later today  and at some point in the future I think  the results are going to be known one  week after the deadline okay I'll let  you guys know how I did in the contest  and whether I want it or not so thank  you guys watching this so far and I hope  you guys stick around for the final  cinematic POV video
 

